{"name":"Golden Fleece","hex":"#edd9aa","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Golden Fleece","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A magical fleece from a winged ram guarded by the hydra in the tale of Jason and the Argonauts.","A chivalric order founded in 1430 by Duke Philip III of Burgundy. Later awarded in Spain and Habsburg Austria."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Golden_Fleece"}],"entries":[{"title":"Golden Fleece","blocks":[{"text":"In Greek mythology, the Golden Fleece is the fleece of the golden-woolled, winged ram, Chrysomallos, which rescued Phrixus and brought him to Colchis, where Phrixus then sacrificed it to Zeus. Phrixus gave the fleece to King Aeëtes, who kept it in a sacred grove, whence Jason and the Argonauts stole it with the help of Medea, Aeëtes's daughter. The fleece is a symbol of authority and kingship."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/dc/Jason_Pelias_Louvre_K127.jpg/330px-Jason_Pelias_Louvre_K127.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Golden_Fleece","wikidata":"Q212262"},{"title":"Golden Fleece (horse)","blocks":[{"text":"Golden Fleece was an American-bred, Irish-trained champion Thoroughbred race horse. In a career which consisted of only four races, he was undefeated, with his most notable success coming on his final racecourse appearance in the 1982 Epsom Derby. In that race he recorded the fastest winning time since before WWII. Sent to stud, the horse contracted stomach cancer and died in March 1984 after only one year's stud duty."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/52/Golden_Fleece.jpg/330px-Golden_Fleece.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Golden_Fleece_(horse)","wikidata":"Q5579400"},{"title":"Gold (color)","blocks":[{"text":"Gold, also called golden, is a color tone resembling the chemical element gold."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5b/GoldNuggetUSGOV.jpg/330px-GoldNuggetUSGOV.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gold_(color)","wikidata":"Q208045"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f5/Placermine.jpg/250px-Placermine.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f5/Placermine.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f5/Placermine.jpg/250px-Placermine.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A sluice box used in placer mining","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APlacermine.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/49/Jason_being_saved_by_Athena_from_the_dragon%2C_Attic_red-figured_kylix%2C_attributed_to_Douris%2C_480-470_BC%2C_inv._16545_-_Museo_Gregoriano_Etrusco_-_Vatican_Museums_-_DSC01046_%28cropped%29.jpg/500px-thumbnail.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/49/Jason_being_saved_by_Athena_from_the_dragon%2C_Attic_red-figured_kylix%2C_attributed_to_Douris%2C_480-470_BC%2C_inv._16545_-_Museo_Gregoriano_Etrusco_-_Vatican_Museums_-_DSC01046_%28cropped%29.jpg/1280px-thumbnail.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/49/Jason_being_saved_by_Athena_from_the_dragon%2C_Attic_red-figured_kylix%2C_attributed_to_Douris%2C_480-470_BC%2C_inv._16545_-_Museo_Gregoriano_Etrusco_-_Vatican_Museums_-_DSC01046_%28cropped%29.jpg/500px-thumbnail.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Athena stands by as Jason is re